ype":"paragraph","text":"ドライのはずなのに、ミルクにつけて\nただのイチゴにしてた(｡･o･｡)ﾉ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドライの意味なっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も飲んだけど\n普通に美味しかったけどね( ◦˙ ˙◦ )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、10/8発売の\n「UTB +」さんの撮影をしてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソログラビア！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソログラビアの機会を中々\n与えてもらえず悔しい日々を過ごしていたので\nとても嬉しいです( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/06/8909717/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほぼほぼすっぴんで、\n髪の毛にはアイロンも当てずに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもナチュラルな撮影でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、インタビューも飾らず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の本音をお話ししました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インタビューを受けていたら\n思わず涙が出てきてしまって\nインタビュー終わるまで止まらなかったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな話なのかはまだ言えないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1時間以上のロングインタビューだったので\n私の事を沢山知れると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、是非\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近くなったらまた告知します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「かくれんぼ」BIGMAMAさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声の優しい雰囲気が好き！\n歌詞や曲と合ってる〜\nそして、ラスサビの歌詞が好き。\n特に\"俯いてなんかいないで\n君らしくありのままで\"\n背中を押してくれるような\nそっと隣にいてくれるような\n暖かさを感じる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメの音楽教えてくれた方\n有難う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いてみるね(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もChihAnswer募集します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん待ってるね( ˘ω˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}